 $16$ | $6$ | $0$ | $1$ | $3$ | $0$ | $16$ | $25$ |" :question/worked-solution "The roots of the function are the values of $x$ such that $f(x)=0.$ In the given table, we see that $f(-2)=0$ and $f(3)=0.$\n\nTherefore, the roots of the function are $x=-2$ and $x=3.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186129816 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186129109 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "82d522a8-ae3c-5723-909e-540ddac1d9da" :knowledge-point/title "Finding the Roots Given a Function Definition"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "9329e5fe-907c-5718-b13e-f03d6a6528ca" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186128378} {:answer/id #uuid "fc4b24ae-2877-5f1e-84c2-bb2b24997352" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186128379} {:answer/id #uuid "0ce02264-4b7f-5d14-aebd-7b7542170bce" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-8" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186128380} {:answer/id #uuid "106f428b-6dea-52de-acb9-72cd10fd727b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{3}{4}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186128381} {:answer/id #uuid "421732f9-4333-574e-bca8-32b1c060cd54" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{2}{3}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186128382}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "0ce02264-4b7f-5d14-aebd-7b7542170bce" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-8" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186128380} :answer-field/id #uuid "a5bd135d-99f8-5aa8-aa93-31549967cbd7" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186128377}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "3460491c-f6b3-5370-8269-8fffeb14eb6f" :question/math-academy-id "q-51497" :question/problem "What is the root of the function $g(x)=\\frac{x}{2}+4?$" :question/worked-solution "The roots are the solutions to the equation $g(x)=0,$ which we solve as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}g(x) & =0 \\\\ \\frac{x}{2}+4 & =0 \\\\ \\frac{x}{2} & =-4 \\\\ x & =2(-4) \\\\ x & =-8\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the function has the single root $x=-8.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186503668 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186129109 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "82d522a8-ae3c-5723-909e-540ddac1d9da" :knowledge-point/title "Finding the Roots Given a Function Definition"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2794ce87-a947-5108-b8fa-e985c689ef9f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186503056} {:answer/id #uuid "6548fce5-29eb-52c1-a26c-7408d0d52849" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186503181} {:answer/id #uuid "9913eeb0-1120-5758-b6e8-0e0b303b40b6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186503283} {:answer/id #uuid "dfd37043-455c-564e-842e-409d3f7027aa" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186503437} {:answer/id #uuid "e679bf99-ebbd-59a6-be49-debbd1010a4e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186503455}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "e679bf99-ebbd-59a6-be49-debbd1010a4e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186503455} :answer-field/id #uuid "66e3b7da-db59-5f84-8105-1a853d4929a3" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186503561}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "24214f4f-5b69-59e3-9894-848806975f44" :question/math-academy-id "q-60890" :question/problem "What is the root of the function $f(x)=3x-6?$" :question/worked-solution "The roots are the solutions to the equation $f(x)=0,$ which we solve as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(x) & =0 \\\\ 3x-6 & =0 \\\\ 3x & =6 \\\\ x & =2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the function has the single root $x=2.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186503698 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186129109 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "82d522a8-ae3c-5723-909e-540ddac1d9da" :knowledge-point/title "Finding the Roots Given a Function Definition"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2581405a-b8c0-5f79-98e1-99d8680c6371" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186503052} {:answer/id #uuid "77274b81-ef22-59bd-9661-11555500d02a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186503218} {:answer/id #uuid "8b3a7994-4969-5df7-9fcc-644c20f5ea08" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186503262} {:answer/id #uuid "b26ce88b-4234-5e07-8be1-b8af7f56ff8d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186503343} {:answer/id #uuid "f2bd1505-96d6-5aae-b69d-971f69c4a205" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{4}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186503474}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "f2bd1505-96d6-5aae-b69d-971f69c4a205" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{4}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186503474} :answer-field/id #uuid "e12e5f7b-b6de-5d51-928d-782cfbd15054" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186503625}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "6b18fe87-24b2-577e-8e31-abad021a59b4" :question/math-academy-id "q-82680" :question/problem "What is the root of the function $f(x)=1-4x?$" :question/worked-solution "The roots are the solutions to the equation $f(x)=0,$ which we solve as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(x) & =0 \\\\ 1-4x & =0 \\\\ 4x & =1 \\\\ x & =\\frac{1}{4}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the function has the single root $x=\\frac{1}{4}.$"}]}
